constraints:
1 ≤ N ≤ 10^{5}
0 ≤ Arr[i] ≤ 10^{18}
Sum of all the elements of the array is greater than 0.

expected time complexity: O(NlogN)
expected auxiliary space: O(N)

standard_solution_code:
import functools

class Solution:

	def compair(self, x, y):
		if x + y > y + x:
			return -1
		else:
			return 1

	def printLargest(self, arr):
		arr.sort(key=functools.cmp_to_key(self.compair))
		return ''.join(map(str, arr))
